      <_ProgramKitCs1701CompatibilityCronosApproval>CS1701&#x9;Orbyss.ProgramKit.Tasks.Schedules.Cronos&#x9;-&#x9;CompilerNoWarn&#x9;cronos:0.13.0|asset:lib/net6.0/Cronos.dll|sha256:e0ad7c799904f1b663ab090b32665e0e90ede27699937588900845383064ba03|system-runtime:10.0.0.0|net10-assets:absent|review-on:provider-change&#x9;human-approval:approved-program-kit-baseline-0.3.0&#x9;2026-07-23&#x9;Approved Cronos 0.13 provider selection uses its exact dependency-free net6.0 asset under net10.0; self-invalidates on package, asset, runtime, or net10-asset availability change.</_ProgramKitCs1701CompatibilityCronosApproval>
