           Text="The CS1701 compatibility quarantine is valid only for the exact canonical test project, MSTest SDK 4.3.2, net10.0, and its exact ledger record." />
    <Error Condition="'$(_ProgramKitCs1701CompatibilityKind)' == 'Cronos' and
